title: An Ideological Concern
subtitle: A district conference questions the line.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_party
view-if: rf_concern_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_concern_timer = 3

= An Ideological Concern

A district conference has passed a resolution against the Zentrale's course: too soft on the Social Democrats, it says, and too slow to prepare for power. The Zentrale must answer.

- @debate
- @discipline
- @ignore

@debate
title: Answer it in an open debate.
subtitle: Calms the <span class="f-left">Left</span>; the leadership looks less sure of itself.
on-arrival: {!
Q.left_dissent -= 5;
Q[Q.leader + '_dissent'] += 2;
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

The debate fills a special supplement of the party paper.

@discipline
title: Remind the district of party discipline.
subtitle: Pleases the leadership's faction; the opposition is angered.
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.leader + '_dissent'] -= 3;
for (var f of window.RF.factions) { if (f != Q.leader) { Q[f + '_dissent'] += 4; } }
window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

A letter from the Zentrale is read out at every local meeting.

@ignore
title: Let it pass.
subtitle: No change, but nothing settled.
on-arrival: {!

window.RF.normalize(Q);
!}

The resolution is filed away.
